{"ref":"BDB, עָרוּם","hw":"עָרוּם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עָרוּם</span></big>  <strong>adj. crafty, shrewd, sensible</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>crafty</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> as pred., of serpent <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:1\" href=\"/Genesis.3.1\">Gn 3:1</a>; pl. as subst. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְשְׁבוֹת עֲרוּמִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 5:12\" href=\"/Job.5.12\">Jb 5:12</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לְשׁוֹן ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 15:5\" href=\"/Job.15.5\">15:5</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  in Pr, in good sense (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱוִיל</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּסִיל</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">פֶּתִי</span>); as attrib. <span dir=\"rtl\">אָדָם עָרוּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.23\">Pr 12:23</a> <em>a shrewd</em> or <em>sensible man;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> as subst. = id., v <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.16\">13:16</a>, so <span dir=\"rtl\">חָכְמַת ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.8\">14:8</a>; = <em>prudent man</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.15\">14:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.3\">22:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.12\">27:12</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲרוּמִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.18\">14:18</a>.","next":"BDB, עֵרָן²","prev":"BDB, עָרְמָה"}